{"ref":"passive:gold-ring","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Gold Ring is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked after obtaining ",{"t":"Yellow Sign","r":"relic:yellow-sign"},". It cannot be found via level ups, and must be found as a stage item."]},{"k":"p","c":["Gold Ring increases ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}," by 5% per level."]},{"k":"p","c":["Gold Ring, alongside ",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:silver-ring"}," ",{"t":"Silver Ring","r":"passive:silver-ring"},", is required for the evolution of ",{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Infinite_Corridor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}," ",{"t":"Infinite Corridor","r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Gold Ring cannot be obtained from level ups, but can be found as a stage item in every stage, except ",{"t":"Tiny Bridge","r":"stage:tiny-bridge"}," and Eudaimonia Machine. Generally, it will spawn south of the starting area. It will always be guarded by a Sun Atlantean. In ",{"t":"Bat Country","r":"stage:bat-country"},", all nine spawn and they are spinning."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["23 May 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["GOLD"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["10"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["9"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+5%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[["Most Stages"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Gold Ring has 9 levels. At max level, Gold Ring provides +40% ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},"."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["... With ... Lancet"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 4"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 5"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 6"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 7"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 8"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 9"]},{"c":["Increases enemy speed, health, quantity, and frequency by 5%."]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"},"\n",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Ring.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:gold-ring"},"\nGold Ring+",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Ring.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:silver-ring"},"\n",{"t":"Silver Ring","r":"passive:silver-ring"}]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Infinite_Corridor.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"},"\n",{"t":"Infinite Corridor","r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Gold Ring does not provide any stats at level 1."]},{"c":["The player can equip the ",{"i":"Sprite-Penshin_Fatcha.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," ",{"t":"Penshin Fatcha","r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," and then evolve it once to get the ",{"i":"Sprite-Vacuum.png","w":24,"h":24}," Lavatrix Machina. When the player touches the Lavatrix Machina, it can attract the Gold Ring while skipping the need to fight the ",{"i":"Sprite-Sun_Atlantean.png","w":14,"h":19}," Sun Atlantean."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 23 May 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Together with the description of ",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:silver-ring"}," ",{"t":"Silver Ring","r":"passive:silver-ring"},", it forms \"Wear with Clock Lancet\", which is a reference to \"Wear in Clock Tower\", the combined description of the ",{"t":"Silver Ring","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Silver_Ring"}," and ",{"t":"Gold Ring","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Gold_Ring"}," in the original English translation of the game ",{"t":"Castlevania: Symphony of the Night","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania:_Symphony_of_the_Night"},"."]},{"c":["Gold Ring, Silver Ring, ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Left.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Left","r":"passive:metaglio-left"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Right.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-right"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Right","r":"passive:metaglio-right"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Outer_Saboteur.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:outer-saboteur"}," ",{"t":"Outer Saboteur","r":"passive:outer-saboteur"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"}," are the only passive items with max level 9 instead of the usual 5."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}